    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/320e35b207014ad99b4543c5f36b45b6.avif?t=1750723827\" data-has-big width=800 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill the Skeletons</strong> \u2013 <i>Embrace the Chaos!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to fight the undead? <strong>Kill the Skeletons</strong> is a <strong>3D clicker battle</strong> where thousands of creatures fly across the battlefield, and hundreds of weapons unleash pure destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tap to Attack, Obliterate the Horde!</i></strong><br>Your reflexes and weapons are your greatest tools. Click to destroy waves of skeletons, buy more weapons and enjoy the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/ebf19bf90ee4768db0b5c084e7a1abaf.poster.avif?t=1750723827\" width=640 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/ebf19bf90ee4768db0b5c084e7a1abaf.webm?t=1750723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thousands of Skeletons, Increasingly Tougher Star Levels!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down thousands of skeletons and take on tougher star-level skeletons that are harder to kill but reward you with tons of gold! Grow your fortune and become unstoppable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/e0f526871d31e990e8d48a45357daef2.poster.avif?t=1750723827\" width=640 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/e0f526871d31e990e8d48a45357daef2.webm?t=1750723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Over 10 Unique Weapons</i></strong><br>From swords and magic casters to laser runes and giant mortars, each weapon has its own mechanics and stunning visual effects!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/253814a39fcfc915d96c7db51f25f99b.poster.avif?t=1750723827\" width=640 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/253814a39fcfc915d96c7db51f25f99b.webm?t=1750723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unlimited Upgrades</i></strong><br>There\u2019s no limit to your power! <strong>Upgrade your weapons and combine them for greater star level weapons\u00a0</strong>to take on even larger enemy swarms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/8609de668dbea0c89c7cabfed06ea548.poster.avif?t=1750723827\" width=640 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/8609de668dbea0c89c7cabfed06ea548.webm?t=1750723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mini-Games &amp; Permanent Upgrades</strong>!<br>The fun never stops! Play mini-games to earn rewards and unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> for an even stronger start each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Three Different Currencies, Three Unique Strategies</strong><br>Each currency has its own mechanics and upgrade paths, allowing you to customize your playstyle and maximize your power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80 <br>The skeleton war is about to begin! <strong>Grab your weapons, control the chaos, and dominate the battlefield!</strong>\u00a0<br>\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/320e35b207014ad99b4543c5f36b45b6.avif?t=1750723827\" data-has-big width=800 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill the Skeletons</strong> \u2013 <i>Embrace the Chaos!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to fight the undead? <strong>Kill the Skeletons</strong> is a <strong>3D clicker battle</strong> where thousands of creatures fly across the battlefield, and hundreds of weapons unleash pure destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tap to Attack, Obliterate the Horde!</i></strong><br>Your reflexes and weapons are your greatest tools. Click to destroy waves of skeletons, buy more weapons and enjoy the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/ebf19bf90ee4768db0b5c084e7a1abaf.poster.avif?t=1750723827\" width=640 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/ebf19bf90ee4768db0b5c084e7a1abaf.webm?t=1750723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thousands of Skeletons, Increasingly Tougher Star Levels!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down thousands of skeletons and take on tougher star-level skeletons that are harder to kill but reward you with tons of gold! Grow your fortune and become unstoppable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/e0f526871d31e990e8d48a45357daef2.poster.avif?t=1750723827\" width=640 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/e0f526871d31e990e8d48a45357daef2.webm?t=1750723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Over 10 Unique Weapons</i></strong><br>From swords and magic casters to laser runes and giant mortars, each weapon has its own mechanics and stunning visual effects!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/253814a39fcfc915d96c7db51f25f99b.poster.avif?t=1750723827\" width=640 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/253814a39fcfc915d96c7db51f25f99b.webm?t=1750723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unlimited Upgrades</i></strong><br>There\u2019s no limit to your power! <strong>Upgrade your weapons and combine them for greater star level weapons\u00a0</strong>to take on even larger enemy swarms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/8609de668dbea0c89c7cabfed06ea548.poster.avif?t=1750723827\" width=640 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548990/extras/8609de668dbea0c89c7cabfed06ea548.webm?t=1750723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mini-Games &amp; Permanent Upgrades</strong>!<br>The fun never stops! Play mini-games to earn rewards and unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> for an even stronger start each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Three Different Currencies, Three Unique Strategies</strong><br>Each currency has its own mechanics and upgrade paths, allowing you to customize your playstyle and maximize your power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80 <br>The skeleton war is about to begin! <strong>Grab your weapons, control the chaos, and dominate the battlefield!</strong>\u00a0<br>\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80</p>",
    "short_description": "Kill the Skeletons is a unique real-time 3D clicker game where you can fully observe the battlefield as chaos unfolds. Watch thousands of creatures and hundreds of weapons in action while strategically clicking to defeat the skeleton horde.",
